{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/projectile-motion/","source":"students/subjects/physics/mechanics/projectile-motion.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Projectile Motion | Physics Mechanics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700\">← Back to Mechanics</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Projectile Motion</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding motion in two dimensions under the influence of gravity</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"grid gap-8\">\n                <!-- Introduction -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">A projectile is any object thrown into space upon which the only force acting is gravity. Key points:</p>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Motion can be analyzed in two independent directions (x and y)</li>\n                            <li>• Horizontal motion has constant velocity (no acceleration)</li>\n                            <li>• Vertical motion has constant acceleration due to gravity</li>\n                            <li>• Path followed is a parabola (in absence of air resistance)</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Motion Analysis -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Motion Analysis</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <!-- Horizontal Motion -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Horizontal Motion (x-direction)</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Key Equations</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• vₓ = v₀cosθ (constant)</li>\n                                        <li>• x = (v₀cosθ)t</li>\n                                        <li>• ax = 0</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Characteristics</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• No acceleration</li>\n                                        <li>• Constant velocity</li>\n                                        <li>• Uniform motion</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Vertical Motion -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Vertical Motion (y-direction)</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Key Equations</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• vy = v₀sinθ - gt</li>\n                                        <li>• y = (v₀sinθ)t - ½gt²</li>\n                                        <li>• ay = -g</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Characteristics</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Constant acceleration (g)</li>\n                                        <li>• Changing velocity</li>\n                                        <li>• Parabolic path</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Important Parameters -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Important Parameters</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <!-- Maximum Height -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Maximum Height</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• hmax = (v₀sinθ)²/2g</li>\n                                        <li>• Vertical velocity = 0</li>\n                                        <li>• Time to reach = v₀sinθ/g</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Time of Flight</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• T = 2v₀sinθ/g</li>\n                                        <li>• Double the time to max height</li>\n                                        <li>• Time to return to initial height</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Range -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Range of Projectile</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Range Formula</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• R = (v₀²sin2θ)/g</li>\n                                        <li>• Maximum at θ = 45°</li>\n                                        <li>• Same for complementary angles</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Factors Affecting Range</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Initial velocity</li>\n                                        <li>• Launch angle</li>\n                                        <li>• Height difference</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Special Cases -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Special Cases</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Horizontal Projection</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• θ = 0°</li>\n                                    <li>• Initial vy = 0</li>\n                                    <li>• Range = v₀√(2h/g)</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Maximum Range</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• θ = 45°</li>\n                                    <li>• R = v₀²/g</li>\n                                    <li>• hmax = v₀²/4g</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Vertical Projection</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• θ = 90°</li>\n                                    <li>• Range = 0</li>\n                                    <li>• hmax = v₀²/2g</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practice Problems -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practice Problems</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Basic Projectile</p>\n                                <p>A ball is thrown with initial velocity 20 m/s at 30° to the horizontal. Calculate:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Maximum height reached</li>\n                                    <li>Time of flight</li>\n                                    <li>Range of the projectile</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Horizontal Projection</p>\n                                <p>A stone is thrown horizontally from a cliff 45m high with velocity 15 m/s. Find:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Time to reach ground</li>\n                                    <li>Horizontal distance traveled</li>\n                                    <li>Velocity at impact</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Maximum Range</p>\n                                <p>What initial velocity is needed to achieve a range of 100m when fired at the optimal angle?</p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-blue-600\">Hint: Use R = v₀²/g at θ = 45°</p>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}